  "Know what needs checking and why.": {"en":"Know what needs checking and why.","pt-BR":"Saiba o que verificar e por quê.","es":"Sabe qué verificar y por qué.","fr":"Sachez quoi vérifier et pourquoi.","de":"Erfahre, was zu prüfen ist und warum.","it":"Scopri cosa verificare e perché."},
