  "These percentages measure steps recorded within TGPI. They do not measure immigration eligibility, job prospects or legal approval.": {"en":"These percentages measure steps recorded within TGPI. They do not measure immigration eligibility, job prospects or legal approval.","pt-BR":"Estes percentuais medem etapas registradas na TGPI. Não medem elegibilidade migratória, chances de emprego ou aprovação legal.","es":"Estos porcentajes miden pasos registrados en TGPI. No miden elegibilidad migratoria, posibilidades de empleo ni aprobación legal.","fr":"Ces pourcentages mesurent les étapes enregistrées dans TGPI. Ils ne mesurent ni l’éligibilité à l’immigration, ni les perspectives d’emploi, ni une autorisation légale.","de":"Diese Prozentsätze messen in TGPI erfasste Schritte. Sie bewerten weder Einwanderungsberechtigung noch Berufsaussichten oder rechtliche Genehmigungen.","it":"Queste percentuali misurano i passaggi registrati in TGPI. Non misurano l’idoneità all’immigrazione, le prospettive di lavoro o un’approvazione legale."},
